{"version":1,"key":"card:452","content":{"id":452,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"布尔值之间可以进行运算，支持三种运算："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"and","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：它接受两个真值，并在这两个值都为真时返回真，否则返回假。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"or","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：接受两个布尔值，二者有一个为真即为真，否则为假"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"not","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：接受一个值，取反"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"短路，一旦第一个布尔值已能确定结果，不在执行第二个表达式。对于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"and","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，第一个为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"False","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么结果一定是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"False","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，第二个是什么不重要。对于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"or","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，第一个是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"True","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 结果就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"True","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]}],"tags":["Python"],"createTime":1719188985123,"updateTime":1743303640441,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640441}}